<title>USA: Springfield, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Springfield, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2.010 million of Springfield, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1508 percent.</p>
</text>
